{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Screen a list of operators"},"description":"Screens up to 200 Railroad Commission of Texas operator numbers at once and returns one row per requested operator, in request order: inactive wellbores on the IWAR, affected, approaching by 2042-09-01 (compliance-plan horizon), contested, review and shared claims, Commission-published plugging cost on affected wellbores with its rate label, unpriced affected count, on editions that carry the Full Wellbore cross-check the affected claims whose wellbore that file flags as plugged (a cross-check only; it changes no outcome, count or cost), the crossing schedule by bucket (empty buckets left out of the rows), the raw P-5 status code, and a 16 TAC \u00a73.78 blanket-assurance floor computed from inactive wells only (a lower bound, not a bond amount). Operators not in the publication come back as found:false rows. Includes totals over the found rows.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"operator_numbers":{"description":"1-200 Railroad Commission of Texas operator numbers as strings (e.g. [\"276959\", \"760218\"]). Shorter numeric strings are left-padded to 6 digits; duplicates are removed, keeping the first occurrence.","items":{"pattern":"^\\d{1,6}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":200,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["operator_numbers"],"type":"object"},"name":"screen_operators","outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"blanket_floor_basis":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"applied_to":{"const":"inactive_wellbores","type":"string"},"label":{"const":"lower bound from inactive wells only; total wells unknown; not a bond amount","type":"string"},"rule":{"const":"16 TAC \u00a73.78","type":"string"},"tiers_usd":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"max_wells":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},{"type